      "x": {
        "id": "2080466972039622848",
        "author_id": "22606322",
        "author_handle": "jonnygravity",
        "author_name": "Jonny Gravity",
        "text": "I've certainly looked to t3code for inspiration on occasion... but atrium's sidebar was an innovation it's had since the very, very early days.\n\nDismiss - shuts down, releases resources, and bumps it to the \"Dismissed\" section\nLater - drops it to the bottom of the Waiting section\nClose - completely closes the session\n\nAnd the next gen of this experience I'm cooking up right now is going to be 1000x more badass.\n\nKeep an eye out ;)",
        "created_at": "2026-07-24T01:35:53Z",
        "first_seen_at": "2026-07-24T16:50:33Z",
        "media": [
          {
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2080466475857436672/img/ut18eoeksp1lU_Vs.jpg",
            "width": 2048,
            "height": 1285,
            "previewUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2080466475857436672/img/ut18eoeksp1lU_Vs.jpg:small",
            "videoUrl": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2080466475857436672/vid/avc1/3442x2160/S0PXDHi17-dvQhU9.mp4?tag=29",
            "durationMs": 30538
          }
        ],
        "metrics": {
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 2,
          "like_count": 4
        },
        "quote": {
          "id": "2076460501123653774",
          "author_handle": "jonnygravity",
          "author_name": "Jonny Gravity",
          "text": "Staying on top of tons of agents is hard.\n\nUnless you're using atrium.\n\nSee all of your agents at a glance with all of the signal you need to know when and where you're needed:\n\n- Permissions requests\n- Question menus\n- Errors\n- Turn ended\n\nAnd all this in a fully configurable surface:\n\n- Change density\n- Group by project or status\n- Maximize, expand, or collapse sections\n\nYou can even send a message directly to an agent from the sidebar. Pop open the Omni-chat or pop out the entire pane to have a full-blown conversation.\n\nIf you run a lot of agents, you need this!\n\n👉 https://t.co/Nowr9tv1uw",
          "created_at": "2026-07-13T00:15:36Z",
